            text-primary-soft-black
          " style="transform:translateY(0);opacity:0;visibility:hidden">Plan your visit</h3><h3 class="
            h3-medium absolute right-0 left-0 mb-0 transition-[transform,color]
            duration-700 ease-in-out
            text-ui-grey-text
          " style="transform:translateY(var(--hero-h1));opacity:0;visibility:hidden">Whakarite mai</h3></div></div><p class="
          body-large mt-4 mb-0 w-full text-primary-soft-black
          desktop:w-2/3
        ">Located in the heart of Auckland CBD, Auckland Art Gallery Toi o Tāmaki is free to visit and open 10am to 5pm every day, except Christmas Day. Here’s everything you need to know to plan your visit to the Gallery.</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 pt-6"><p class="body-small mb-0 text-primary-soft-black">Jump to</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1"><p class="
        body-small mb-0 inline-flex h-[30px] cursor-pointer items-center
