   py-5"><div class="min-h-0 flex flex-col gap-6 break-words rich-editor-content text-primary-soft-black desktop:max-w-[70%]"><h4 style="color: inherit;" class="h4 mb-0 call-to-action-heading-dot">Location and opening hours</h4>

<p class="body-large">Corner of Wellesley Street East and Kitchener Street, Auckland, Aotearoa New Zealand 1010</p>

<p class="body-large">Enter through the main doors at 1 Kitchener Street.</p>

<p class="body-large">Open every day from 10am to 5pm, except Christmas Day.</p>
</div><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Auckland+Art+Gallery/@-36.851354,174.7636621,17z/data=!3m2!4b1!5s0x6d0d47e4cf20b07b:0x6b79e1629f710530!4m6!3m5!1s0x6d0d47fb2e12486d:0x3e90bef6528b7215!8m2!3d-36.851354!4d174.766237!16zL20vMDlzeHpf?entry=tts&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDEyNy4wIPu8ASoASAFQAw%3D%3D&amp;skid=5d008306-f3dd-44ef-ac8a-82094d198a6f" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary cta-1 inline-flex hover-right desktop:w-fit desktop:min-w-[180px] has-icon-gap shrink-0">Get directions<span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center"><svg viewBox="0 0 56 61" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_480_65652)"><line x1="24.4876" y1="3.52122" x2="53.4789" y2="32.5126" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></line><line x1="52.5198" y1="28.4292" x2="24.0174" y2="57.9014" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></line><path d="M45.9676 30.0751L0.140814 29.6695" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_480_65652"><rect width="61" height="56" fill="currentColor" transform="translate(56 2.44784e-06) rotate(90)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></span></a></div><div class="flex min-h-0 min-w-0 w-full overflow-hidden 
    flex-col
    desktop:w-1/2 desktop:min-w-0 desktop:flex-none
  "><div class="
        relative w-full overflow-hidden
        
    max-h-full min-h-0 w-full max-w-full
    desktop:min-w-0
   aspect-[700/750] min-h-0 flex-1 max-h-full w-auto
      "><div class="
          absolute left-0 w-full bg-center bg-no-repeat
          top-0 bg-cover
          
        " style="height:140%;top:-20%;background-image:url(https://cdn.aucklandunlimited.com/aag/assets/media/auckland-art-gallery-building-entrance.jpg)"></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><div id="ticketing-and-admission-1"><div class="
      pb-8
      desktop:pb-16
    "><div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-center gap-3 p-4 desktop:px-8 desktop:py-6"><h5 class="h5-medium">Ticketing and admission</h5></div><div class="p-4 desktop:px-8 desktop:py-6"><div class="rich-editor-content mx-auto max-w-[674px]"><p class="body-large">Admission to our general collection exhibitions is <strong>free for all</strong>. Children under the age of 14 must be accompanied by an adult.&nbsp;</p>

<p class="body-large">Charges may apply for special exhibitions and events. Check our <a href="/visit/events">events page</a>&nbsp;and <a href="/visit/exhibitions">exhibitions page</a> for more information.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div><div class="border-t"></div><section class="
        content-padding-x w-full py-6
        desktop:py-8
      " aria-labelledby="_R_8ql75_-title"><h5 id="_R_8ql75_-title" class="
            h5-medium mb-4 text-left
            desktop:mb-6
          ">Welcome to Auckland Art Gallery</h5><div class="
            rich-editor-content mb-4
            desktop:mb-6 desktop:ml-0 desktop:w-1/2
          "><p class="body-large">Auckland Art Gallery hosts&nbsp;one of Aotearoa New Zealand&rsquo;s largest and most inspiring collections of visual art.&nbsp;From the moment you enter,&nbsp;you&rsquo;ll&nbsp;be greeted by our friendly gallery assistants, who are available throughout the building to help with anything you need.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>

<p class="body-large">Housed in one of the city&rsquo;s most iconic buildings,&nbsp;Auckland Art Gallery&nbsp;Toi o&nbsp;Tāmaki&nbsp;includes 4 floors of exhibition&nbsp;spaces&nbsp;and&nbsp;showcases&nbsp;some of the best in New Zealand,&nbsp;Māori&nbsp;and Pacific art.&nbsp;</p>

<p class="body-large"><a class="small primary button custom-btn" href="/connect/about-us" target="_blank">About us</a></p>
