      disabled:opacity-40 disabled:hover:text-inherit
    " aria-label="Next image" disabled=""><p class="body-small mb-0">Next</p><svg viewBox="0 0 56 61" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="ml-2 h-4 w-4"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_480_65652)"><line x1="24.4876" y1="3.52122" x2="53.4789" y2="32.5126" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></line><line x1="52.5198" y1="28.4292" x2="24.0174" y2="57.9014" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></line><path d="M45.9676 30.0751L0.140814 29.6695" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_480_65652"><rect width="61" height="56" fill="currentColor" transform="translate(56 2.44784e-06) rotate(90)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></button></div></div></div></div></section></div><div id="getting-here-3"><div class="border-t"></div><section class="
      pb-14
      desktop:pb-18
    "><h3 class="h5-medium content-padding-x py-4">Getting here</h3><div id="_R_92l75_"><div class="not-last:border-b"><button type="button" class="
          content-padding-x flex w-full justify-between pt-6 pb-4 text-left
          transition-colors
          hover:text-primary-red
          desktop:px-28
        " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_6p2l75_" id="_R_6p2l75H1_"><h4 class="
          body-large
          
        ">By bus, train or ferry</h4><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="
              h-5 w-5 shrink-0
              motion-safe:transition-transform motion-safe:duration-300
            "><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="
        grid ease-in-out
        motion-safe:transition-[grid-template-rows] motion-safe:duration-300
        grid-rows-[0fr]
      "><div class="
          overflow-hidden
          motion-safe:transition-[visibility] motion-safe:duration-300
         invisible"><div id="_R_6p2l75_" aria-labelledby="_R_6p2l75H1_" class="
              rich-editor-content content-padding-x pt-2 pb-8
              desktop:px-28
            "><p class="body-small">The closest train station to the Gallery is Te Waihorotiu, which is less than 10 minutes away on foot. The&nbsp;Waitematā train station and the Auckland CBD Ferry Terminal are a 15-minute walk away.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>

<p class="body-small">Auckland City Centre is serviced by Link buses to help you get around the CBD.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>

<ul>
	<li>
	<p class="body-small">The OuterLink bus stops on Wellesley Street East near the corner of Lorne Street, which is a 1-minute walk to the Gallery.&nbsp;</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p class="body-small">The CityLink bus stops on Queen Street near the corner of Wellesley Street East, which is a 3-minute walk to the Gallery.&nbsp;</p>
	</li>
</ul>

<p class="body-small">Plan your journey using the <a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner/?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2026-09-11T13%3A06%3A49%2B12%3A00&amp;time=1%3A10pm&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;isCRLPreviewOn=false">Auckland Transport journey planner</a> for the&nbsp;most up to date information about buses, trains and ferries.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>

<p class="body-small">Auckland Transport also has the handy AT Mobile app to help you plan, save and track journeys across Auckland. Download the app from the <a href="https://itunes.apple.com/nz/app/at-mobile/id1207704356?mt=8" target="_blank">App Store</a>&nbsp;or the <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=nz.govt.at.atmobile&amp;hl=en" target="_blank">Google Play</a> store.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div class="not-last:border-b"><button type="button" class="
          content-padding-x flex w-full justify-between pt-6 pb-4 text-left
          transition-colors
          hover:text-primary-red
          desktop:px-28
        " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_ap2l75_" id="_R_ap2l75H1_"><h4 class="
          body-large
          
        ">By car or taxi</h4><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="
              h-5 w-5 shrink-0
              motion-safe:transition-transform motion-safe:duration-300
            "><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="
        grid ease-in-out
        motion-safe:transition-[grid-template-rows] motion-safe:duration-300
        grid-rows-[0fr]
      "><div class="
          overflow-hidden
          motion-safe:transition-[visibility] motion-safe:duration-300
         invisible"><div id="_R_ap2l75_" aria-labelledby="_R_ap2l75H1_" class="
              rich-editor-content content-padding-x pt-2 pb-8
              desktop:px-28
            "><p class="body-small">You&rsquo;ll find many public and private car parks nearby.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>

<p class="body-small">The closest public car park is Auckland Transport&rsquo;s <a href="https://at.govt.nz/driving-and-parking/find-parking/parking-in-central-auckland/victoria-street-car-park" target="_blank">Victoria Street East car park</a>,&nbsp;which is a 4-minute walk from the Gallery. Rates start from $2.50 per hour on evenings, weekends and public holidays and $5.50 per hour on weekdays.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>

<p class="body-small">Parking rates vary based on time and location. Check the <a href="https://at.govt.nz/driving-and-parking/find-parking/parking-in-central-auckland" target="_blank">Auckland Transport website</a>&nbsp;for more nearby parking options and pricing.&nbsp;</p>

<p class="body-small">Taxis can pick up and drop off from the loading bays in front of the Gallery on Kitchener Street.&nbsp;</p>
</div></div></div></div><div class="not-last:border-b"><button type="button" class="
          content-padding-x flex w-full justify-between pt-6 pb-4 text-left
          transition-colors
          hover:text-primary-red
          desktop:px-28
        " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_ep2l75_" id="_R_ep2l75H1_"><h4 class="
          body-large
          
        ">By bike</h4><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="
              h-5 w-5 shrink-0
              motion-safe:transition-transform motion-safe:duration-300
            "><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="
        grid ease-in-out
        motion-safe:transition-[grid-template-rows] motion-safe:duration-300
        grid-rows-[0fr]
      "><div class="
          overflow-hidden
          motion-safe:transition-[visibility] motion-safe:duration-300
         invisible"><div id="_R_ep2l75_" aria-labelledby="_R_ep2l75H1_" class="
              rich-editor-content content-padding-x pt-2 pb-8
              desktop:px-28
            "><p class="body-small">Auckland City Centre is well connected to other parts of the city by shared paths and dedicated cycleways. Check the <a href="https://mahere.at.govt.nz/portal/apps/experiencebuilder/experience/?id=0547bd817663487f9c148da9da284933&amp;_gl=1*1cqk3ly*_gcl_au*MjQxMzkwNTgxLjE3NjQxOTM5Mzg.*_ga*NTU1MDIyMjYuMTc2NDE5MzkzOA..*_ga_WNC2W47P8Y*czE3Njk3MjMxMDkkbzckZzEkdDE3Njk3MjUwMzUkajU4JGwwJGgw" target="_blank">Auckland Transport cycleway map</a> for routes and information.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>

<p class="body-small">There are bike racks for parking directly opposite the Gallery&rsquo;s main entrance on Kitchener Street.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
</div></div></div></div></div></section></div><div id="explore-the-gallery-4"><div class="border-t"></div><section class="
      content-padding-x
      max-width-container pb-10
      desktop:pb-20
    "><div class="
          flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-6 pt-4 pb-9
          desktop:flex-row desktop:pt-5 desktop:pb-4
        "><h2 class="h5-medium mb-0">Explore Auckland Art Gallery</h2></div><div class="
        grid grid-cols-1 gap-y-9
        desktop:grid-cols-3 desktop:gap-x-8 desktop:gap-y-10
      "><a class="group block" href="/visit/tours-and-group-visits" data-discover="true"><div class="mb-4 aspect-3/2 w-full"><img class="
                  h-full w-full scale-100 object-cover transition-[scale]
                  duration-300 ease-out
                  group-hover:scale-102
                " src="https://cdn.aucklandunlimited.com/aag/assets/media/tours-auckland-art-gallery-thumbnail-web.jpg" alt="Tours and group visits"/></div><div class="body-large mb-1 flex justify-between align-top"><strong class="
          transition-colors duration-300
          group-hover:text-primary-red
        ">Tours and group visits</strong></div><p class="
        body-small mb-3 transition-colors duration-300
        group-hover:text-primary-red
      ">Find out more about our free general collection tours, plus exhibition tours and other group visits to the Gallery.</p><p class="
        body-small hidden transition-colors duration-300
        group-hover:text-primary-red
        desktop:block
      ">Learn more</p><div class="desktop:hidden"><button type="button" class="btn-primary-clear h-fit cta-1 inline-flex hover-right desktop:w-fit desktop:min-w-[180px] has-icon-gap cta-1">Learn more<span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center"><svg viewBox="0 0 56 61" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-2 w-2"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_480_65652)"><line x1="24.4876" y1="3.52122" x2="53.4789" y2="32.5126" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></line><line x1="52.5198" y1="28.4292" x2="24.0174" y2="57.9014" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></line><path d="M45.9676 30.0751L0.140814 29.6695" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_480_65652"><rect width="61" height="56" fill="currentColor" transform="translate(56 2.44784e-06) rotate(90)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></span></button></div></a><a class="group block" href="/visit/cafe" data-discover="true"><div class="mb-4 aspect-3/2 w-full"><img class="
                  h-full w-full scale-100 object-cover transition-[scale]
                  duration-300 ease-out
                  group-hover:scale-102
                " src="https://cdn.aucklandunlimited.com/aag/assets/media/cafe-670x450.jpg" alt="Café"/></div><div class="body-large mb-1 flex justify-between align-top"><strong class="
          transition-colors duration-300
          group-hover:text-primary-red
        ">Café</strong></div><p class="
        body-small mb-3 transition-colors duration-300
        group-hover:text-primary-red
      ">Discover the café at Auckland Art Gallery Toi o Tāmaki, serving delicious food and coffee daily in our sunny space just off Albert Park.</p><p class="
        body-small hidden transition-colors duration-300
        group-hover:text-primary-red
        desktop:block
      ">Learn more</p><div class="desktop:hidden"><button type="button" class="btn-primary-clear h-fit cta-1 inline-flex hover-right desktop:w-fit desktop:min-w-[180px] has-icon-gap cta-1">Learn more<span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center"><svg viewBox="0 0 56 61" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-2 w-2"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_480_65652)"><line x1="24.4876" y1="3.52122" x2="53.4789" y2="32.5126" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></line><line x1="52.5198" y1="28.4292" x2="24.0174" y2="57.9014" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></line><path d="M45.9676 30.0751L0.140814 29.6695" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_480_65652"><rect width="61" height="56" fill="currentColor" transform="translate(56 2.44784e-06) rotate(90)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></span></button></div></a><a class="group block" href="/explore/education-programmes" data-discover="true"><div class="mb-4 aspect-3/2 w-full"><img class="
                  h-full w-full scale-100 object-cover transition-[scale]
                  duration-300 ease-out
                  group-hover:scale-102
                " src="https://cdn.aucklandunlimited.com/aag/assets/media/education-programmes-auckland-art-gallery-web.jpg" alt="Education programmes"/></div><div class="body-large mb-1 flex justify-between align-top"><strong class="
          transition-colors duration-300
          group-hover:text-primary-red
        ">Education programmes</strong></div><p class="
        body-small mb-3 transition-colors duration-300
        group-hover:text-primary-red
      ">The Gallery has free education programmes and resources for students of all ages. Find out more and book the learning experience that’s right for your class.</p><p class="
        body-small hidden transition-colors duration-300
        group-hover:text-primary-red
        desktop:block
      ">Learn more</p><div class="desktop:hidden"><button type="button" class="btn-primary-clear h-fit cta-1 inline-flex hover-right desktop:w-fit desktop:min-w-[180px] has-icon-gap cta-1">Learn more<span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center"><svg viewBox="0 0 56 61" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-2 w-2"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_480_65652)"><line x1="24.4876" y1="3.52122" x2="53.4789" y2="32.5126" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></line><line x1="52.5198" y1="28.4292" x2="24.0174" y2="57.9014" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></line><path d="M45.9676 30.0751L0.140814 29.6695" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_480_65652"><rect width="61" height="56" fill="currentColor" transform="translate(56 2.44784e-06) rotate(90)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></span></button></div></a><a class="group block" href="/visit/accessibility" data-discover="true"><div class="mb-4 aspect-3/2 w-full"><img class="
                  h-full w-full scale-100 object-cover transition-[scale]
                  duration-300 ease-out
                  group-hover:scale-102
                " src="https://cdn.aucklandunlimited.com/aag/assets/media/accessibility-at-auckland-art-gallery-thumbnail-mobile.jpg" alt="Accessibility"/></div><div class="body-large mb-1 flex justify-between align-top"><strong class="
          transition-colors duration-300
          group-hover:text-primary-red
        ">Accessibility</strong></div><p class="
        body-small mb-3 transition-colors duration-300
        group-hover:text-primary-red
      ">If you have accessibility needs and want to get more involved or visit us, find out how the Gallery can support you.</p><p class="
        body-small hidden transition-colors duration-300
        group-hover:text-primary-red
        desktop:block
      ">Learn more</p><div class="desktop:hidden"><button type="button" class="btn-primary-clear h-fit cta-1 inline-flex hover-right desktop:w-fit desktop:min-w-[180px] has-icon-gap cta-1">Learn more<span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center"><svg viewBox="0 0 56 61" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-2 w-2"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_480_65652)"><line x1="24.4876" y1="3.52122" x2="53.4789" y2="32.5126" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></line><line x1="52.5198" y1="28.4292" x2="24.0174" y2="57.9014" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></line><path d="M45.9676 30.0751L0.140814 29.6695" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_480_65652"><rect width="61" height="56" fill="currentColor" transform="translate(56 2.44784e-06) rotate(90)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></span></button></div></a><a class="group block" href="/visit/members-lounge" data-discover="true"><div class="mb-4 aspect-3/2 w-full"><img class="
                  h-full w-full scale-100 object-cover transition-[scale]
                  duration-300 ease-out
                  group-hover:scale-102
                " src="https://cdn.aucklandunlimited.com/aag/assets/media/auckland-art-gallery-members-lounge-web-thumbnail.jpg" alt="Members lounge"/></div><div class="body-large mb-1 flex justify-between align-top"><strong class="
          transition-colors duration-300
          group-hover:text-primary-red
        ">Members lounge</strong></div><p class="
        body-small mb-3 transition-colors duration-300
        group-hover:text-primary-red
      ">Find out more about the Members lounge including opening hours, access and private hire.</p><p class="
        body-small hidden transition-colors duration-300
        group-hover:text-primary-red
        desktop:block
      ">Learn more</p><div class="desktop:hidden"><button type="button" class="btn-primary-clear h-fit cta-1 inline-flex hover-right desktop:w-fit desktop:min-w-[180px] has-icon-gap cta-1">Learn more<span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center"><svg viewBox="0 0 56 61" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-2 w-2"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_480_65652)"><line x1="24.4876" y1="3.52122" x2="53.4789" y2="32.5126" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></line><line x1="52.5198" y1="28.4292" x2="24.0174" y2="57.9014" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></line><path d="M45.9676 30.0751L0.140814 29.6695" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_480_65652"><rect width="61" height="56" fill="currentColor" transform="translate(56 2.44784e-06) rotate(90)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></span></button></div></a><a class="group block" href="/explore/library-and-archive" data-discover="true"><div class="mb-4 aspect-3/2 w-full"><img class="
