        "><line y1="1.14689" x2="13.7647" y2="1.14689" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.29412"></line><line x1="12.6178" y1="0.655273" x2="12.6178" y2="13.6553" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.29412"></line><line x1="12.3429" y1="1.89636" x2="0.804884" y2="13.232" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.29412"></line></svg></div><div class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1"><div class="inline rounded-full border px-2 py-[1px] text-xs">Page</div></div><div class="mb-4 flex w-full flex-col gap-2"><p class="h7 mb-3">Explore what&#x27;s on at Auckland Art Gallery Toi o Tāmaki. Find talks, tours, workshops, family-friendly events and more.</p></div><p class="
        body-small mb-0 hidden
        desktop:block
      ">Learn more</p><div class="desktop:hidden"><button type="button" class="btn-primary-clear h-fit cta-1 inline-flex hover-right desktop:w-fit desktop:min-w-[180px] has-icon-gap cta-1">Learn more<span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center"><svg viewBox="0 0 56 61" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_480_65652)"><line x1="24.4876" y1="3.52122" x2="53.4789" y2="32.5126" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></line><line x1="52.5198" y1="28.4292" x2="24.0174" y2="57.9014" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></line><path d="M45.9676 30.0751L0.140814 29.6695" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_480_65652"><rect width="61" height="56" fill="currentColor" transform="translate(56 2.44784e-06) rotate(90)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></span></button></div></a></div></section></div><div id="get-in-touch-8"><div class="border-t"></div><div class="
      pb-8
      desktop:pb-16
    "><div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-center gap-3 p-4 desktop:px-8 desktop:py-6"><h5 class="h5-medium">Get in touch</h5><a class="btn-primary-clear h-fit cta-1 inline-flex size-sm inline-block" href="/connect/get-in-touch" data-discover="true">Contact us</a></div><div class="p-4 desktop:px-8 desktop:py-6"><div class="rich-editor-content mx-auto max-w-[674px]"><p class="body-large"><strong>Have questions?</strong> We&rsquo;re happy to help. Fill out the form to contact us and we&rsquo;ll get back to you as soon as possible.&nbsp;</p>
</div></div></div></div><div><div class="border-t"></div><section class="viewport-height-wrapper"><div class="
        flex flex-col items-stretch gap-0
        desktop:flex-row
      "><div class="
            flex flex-col items-start justify-start gap-6 px-4 pt-5 pb-20
            desktop:w-1/2 desktop:min-w-0 desktop:p-8
          " style="background-color:var(--color-maori-peony)"><div class="
                flex w-full max-w-full flex-col gap-6 text-primary-true-white
              "><h3 style="color: inherit;" class="h3 mb-0">Become a Member today</h3>

<p class="body-medium">Get more from the Gallery. Membership comes with tons of benefits like free entry to all exhibitions, 10% off in the shop, access to the Members lounge and much more.</p>
</div><a class="btn-primary cta-1 inline-flex hover-right desktop:w-fit desktop:min-w-[180px] has-icon-gap 
                max-w-full
                desktop:min-w-0
              " href="/membership" data-discover="true">Become a Member<span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center"><svg viewBox="0 0 56 61" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_480_65652)"><line x1="24.4876" y1="3.52122" x2="53.4789" y2="32.5126" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></line><line x1="52.5198" y1="28.4292" x2="24.0174" y2="57.9014" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></line><path d="M45.9676 30.0751L0.140814 29.6695" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="7"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_480_65652"><rect width="61" height="56" fill="currentColor" transform="translate(56 2.44784e-06) rotate(90)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></span></a></div><div class="
            relative flex aspect-[700/530] w-full flex-col overflow-hidden
            desktop:w-1/2
          " style="background-color:var(--color-maori-peony)"><div class="
        relative w-full overflow-hidden
        
              h-full w-full
              desktop:min-w-[300px]
            
      "><div class="
          absolute left-0 w-full bg-center bg-no-repeat
          top-0 bg-cover
          
        " style="height:140%;top:-20%;background-image:url(/assets/patikitiki-peony-Bcwq6YKV.svg)"></div></div></div></div></section></div><div id="faq-10"><div class="border-t"></div><section class="
      pb-14
      desktop:pb-18
    "><h3 class="h5-medium content-padding-x py-4">Visitor FAQs</h3><div id="_R_aql75_"><div class="not-last:border-b"><button type="button" class="
          content-padding-x flex w-full justify-between pt-6 pb-4 text-left
          transition-colors
          hover:text-primary-red
          desktop:px-28
        " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_6qql75_" id="_R_6qql75H1_"><h4 class="
          body-large
          
        ">Is free Wi-Fi available at the Gallery?</h4><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="
              h-5 w-5 shrink-0
              motion-safe:transition-transform motion-safe:duration-300
            "><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="
        grid ease-in-out
        motion-safe:transition-[grid-template-rows] motion-safe:duration-300
        grid-rows-[0fr]
      "><div class="
          overflow-hidden
          motion-safe:transition-[visibility] motion-safe:duration-300
         invisible"><div id="_R_6qql75_" aria-labelledby="_R_6qql75H1_" class="
              rich-editor-content content-padding-x pt-2 pb-8
              desktop:px-28
            "><p class="body-small">Free Wi-Fi access is available inside the Gallery. It is capped at 1GB of free data per calendar day.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>

<p class="body-small">To connect:&nbsp;</p>

<ul>
	<li>Enable Wi-Fi on your device&nbsp;</li>
	<li>Select &lsquo;Auckland Art Gallery&rsquo; &ndash; a login page will automatically open&nbsp;</li>
	<li>Click &lsquo;Accept&rsquo; to get online.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
</div></div></div></div><div class="not-last:border-b"><button type="button" class="
          content-padding-x flex w-full justify-between pt-6 pb-4 text-left
          transition-colors
          hover:text-primary-red
          desktop:px-28
        " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_aqql75_" id="_R_aqql75H1_"><h4 class="
          body-large
          
        ">What can I bring into the Gallery with me?</h4><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="
              h-5 w-5 shrink-0
              motion-safe:transition-transform motion-safe:duration-300
            "><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="
        grid ease-in-out
        motion-safe:transition-[grid-template-rows] motion-safe:duration-300
        grid-rows-[0fr]
      "><div class="
          overflow-hidden
          motion-safe:transition-[visibility] motion-safe:duration-300
         invisible"><div id="_R_aqql75_" aria-labelledby="_R_aqql75H1_" class="
              rich-editor-content content-padding-x pt-2 pb-8
              desktop:px-28
            "><p class="body-small">We require visitors to check umbrellas, backpacks, shopping bags and large bags into our free cloakroom. To ensure the safety of artworks, the Gallery does not permit visitors to wear bags on their backs in the galleries. The Gallery reserves the right to refuse other items and is not responsible for items held in the cloakroom.&nbsp;</p>
</div></div></div></div><div class="not-last:border-b"><button type="button" class="
          content-padding-x flex w-full justify-between pt-6 pb-4 text-left
          transition-colors
          hover:text-primary-red
          desktop:px-28
        " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_eqql75_" id="_R_eqql75H1_"><h4 class="
          body-large
          
        ">Where can I eat or drink in the Gallery?</h4><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="
              h-5 w-5 shrink-0
              motion-safe:transition-transform motion-safe:duration-300
            "><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="
        grid ease-in-out
        motion-safe:transition-[grid-template-rows] motion-safe:duration-300
        grid-rows-[0fr]
      "><div class="
          overflow-hidden
          motion-safe:transition-[visibility] motion-safe:duration-300
         invisible"><div id="_R_eqql75_" aria-labelledby="_R_eqql75H1_" class="
              rich-editor-content content-padding-x pt-2 pb-8
              desktop:px-28
            "><p class="body-small">No food or drink is permitted in the Gallery, so we recommend a visit to our caf&eacute; on level 1. If you have brought your own lunch, a nice spot to eat is in our amphitheatre behind the Gallery or in Albert Park.&nbsp;</p>

<p class="body-small">People who breastfeed are welcome to feed their babies on any of the public seating in the galleries. If you wish for a more private spot, there is a chair available in the accessible bathroom on the mezzanine floor.&nbsp;</p>

<p class="body-small">Due to restrictions on food and drink around artworks, bottle feeding for babies or toddlers can only take place in the seating areas in our North Atrium, South Atrium, up on the East Terrace or in the entrance foyer. Likewise, if children need a top-up of food during their visit, please use these areas only. We can assist in guiding you to the right area, so please ask the nearest gallery assistant for help.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div class="not-last:border-b"><button type="button" class="
          content-padding-x flex w-full justify-between pt-6 pb-4 text-left
          transition-colors
          hover:text-primary-red
          desktop:px-28
        " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_iqql75_" id="_R_iqql75H1_"><h4 class="
          body-large
          
        ">Can I smoke or vape in the Gallery?</h4><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="
              h-5 w-5 shrink-0
              motion-safe:transition-transform motion-safe:duration-300
            "><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="
        grid ease-in-out
        motion-safe:transition-[grid-template-rows] motion-safe:duration-300
        grid-rows-[0fr]
      "><div class="
          overflow-hidden
          motion-safe:transition-[visibility] motion-safe:duration-300
         invisible"><div id="_R_iqql75_" aria-labelledby="_R_iqql75H1_" class="
              rich-editor-content content-padding-x pt-2 pb-8
              desktop:px-28
            "><p class="body-small">Smoking and vaping are not permitted anywhere in the Gallery.&nbsp;</p>
</div></div></div></div><div class="not-last:border-b"><button type="button" class="
          content-padding-x flex w-full justify-between pt-6 pb-4 text-left
          transition-colors
          hover:text-primary-red
          desktop:px-28
        " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_mqql75_" id="_R_mqql75H1_"><h4 class="
          body-large
          
        ">Can I host an event or party in the Gallery?</h4><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="
              h-5 w-5 shrink-0
              motion-safe:transition-transform motion-safe:duration-300
            "><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="
        grid ease-in-out
        motion-safe:transition-[grid-template-rows] motion-safe:duration-300
        grid-rows-[0fr]
      "><div class="
          overflow-hidden
          motion-safe:transition-[visibility] motion-safe:duration-300
         invisible"><div id="_R_mqql75_" aria-labelledby="_R_mqql75H1_" class="
              rich-editor-content content-padding-x pt-2 pb-8
              desktop:px-28
            "><p class="body-small">While we encourage you to celebrate birthdays and other special events with a visit, large groups should contact the Gallery prior to arrival to see if we can facilitate your request.&nbsp;</p>

<p class="body-small">Please note: Parties are not permitted in the galleries or public spaces. Celebrations may only be held in a pre-booked venue within the Gallery. To find out more about venue hire in the Gallery spaces, visit the<a href="https://www.aucklandconventions.co.nz/venues/auckland-art-gallery" target="_blank"> Auckland Conventions, Venues &amp; Events website</a>.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div class="not-last:border-b"><button type="button" class="
          content-padding-x flex w-full justify-between pt-6 pb-4 text-left
          transition-colors
          hover:text-primary-red
          desktop:px-28
        " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_qqql75_" id="_R_qqql75H1_"><h4 class="
          body-large
          
        ">Can I photograph or film inside the Gallery?</h4><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="
              h-5 w-5 shrink-0
              motion-safe:transition-transform motion-safe:duration-300
            "><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="
        grid ease-in-out
        motion-safe:transition-[grid-template-rows] motion-safe:duration-300
        grid-rows-[0fr]
      "><div class="
          overflow-hidden
          motion-safe:transition-[visibility] motion-safe:duration-300
         invisible"><div id="_R_qqql75_" aria-labelledby="_R_qqql75H1_" class="
              rich-editor-content content-padding-x pt-2 pb-8
              desktop:px-28
            "><p class="body-small">We encourage visitors to capture their favourite works and memories of visiting our exhibitions on display. However, to preserve the artworks and visitor experience, please adhere to the following photography and filming guidelines:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Photos and videos can be taken with&nbsp;hand-held cameras for personal use only.</li>
	<li>Filming and photography should not disrupt other visitors or be disrespectful to artworks or exhibitions.&nbsp;</li>
	<li>Livestreaming is not permitted without the Gallery&#39;s prior permission.&nbsp;</li>
	<li>To reduce the risk of damage to the art, the use of tripods, selfie sticks, external stabilising devices or other camera attachments, flash or additional lighting is not permitted without the permission of the Gallery. A request must be made and granted before such equipment can be used in any Gallery spaces.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>
	<li>Any images taken should not be reproduced or displayed on personal or company websites and must not be sold commercially or displayed publicly in any way that disrespects the subjects in the artworks or causes offence to any individuals or groups.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>
	<li>Please follow any &lsquo;No photography&rsquo; signage as this indicates objects, exhibitions or events that cannot be filmed or photographed. This restriction may be for cultural reasons, due to copyright law, privacy, or to protect the people or objects involved.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>
</ul>

<p class="body-small">If these guidelines are not followed, you may be asked to stop taking photos and/or filming.&nbsp;</p>

<p class="body-small">To request permission for photography or filming, please contact us via <a href="mailto:marketing@aucklandartgallery.com?subject=Photography%20and%20filming%20enquiry">marketing@aucklandartgallery.com</a>. Please allow at least 5 working days for a response. Filming and photography are not always possible and may incur a fee. See our <a href="https://www.aucklandartgallery.com/page/privacy-policy" target="_blank">copyright</a><a href="https://www.aucklandartgallery.com/page/privacy-policy">&nbsp;and privacy policy</a> for more information.&nbsp;</p>
</div></div></div></div></div><div class="
